**Read:** the complete [Calibration of aerosol instruments — Chen, Fletcher and Cheng](../sources/Aerosol-Instrument-Calibration-Chen-Fletcher-Cheng.lingua#r_03PDE8353KQ9HQKJNAHRH99NPP), [CPC proportionality calibration — Owen, Mulholland and Guthrie](../sources/CPC-Proportionality-Calibration-Owen-Mulholland-Guthrie.lingua#r_7XKKJ1Q7HNDS2BEPSHZDJMTKVE) and [Mobility particle size spectrometers — Wiedensohler and colleagues](../sources/Mobility-Particle-Size-Spectrometers-Wiedensohler.lingua#r_1W06WPADV43B98EF8NSW9RDCWM) readings. Revisit the quantitative and metrology Records where the derivations need more work.

The following investigations combine transport, response, calibration and inference. One follows material through a sampling path, another tests a counting calibration, and the third reconstructs a size distribution. They meet again at a review of what the observations establish.

Use a declared teaching dataset or a published dataset whose provenance is preserved. Keep units, raw observations, model assumptions and numerical methods inspectable. A simulated experiment can test reasoning and computation; identify it as simulated when discussing what was demonstrated.

**Work:** Carry each investigation far enough to expose a plausible competing explanation and design an observation that distinguishes it. Compare the resources required for that observation with the consequence of the unresolved question. Keep the process requirement visible throughout the calculation.

**Return:** [Clean manufacturing and contamination control — from familiar objects to controlled processes](../Clean-manufacturing-and-contamination-control.lingua#r_7D8SQ8BVQDZQBDBGC6DP0JAMZN).
**Continue in clean manufacturing:** [Investigate an inlet, line and counter together](Investigate-an-inlet-line-and-counter-together.lingua#r_09KGTHY49N9ZWR6Q39R41P3Z8W), [Defend a counter calibration across concentration](Defend-a-counter-calibration-across-concentration.lingua#r_5W8P5PZA8H09QF8Y798VCYQRQK), [Recover only the size information the observations support](Recover-only-the-size-information-the-observations-support.lingua#r_2R0Z7YQPNH0T7ED7H3W5SQR1NB).

